OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASea safety warning as deaths
OL,4,Arecalled 10 years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FRenewed sea safety warnings have been
OL,7,Fmade on the 10th anniversary of the
OL,8,Fdeaths of five friends at Camber Sands.
OL,10,FKenugen Saththiyanathan, Kobikanthan
OL,11,FSaththiyanathan, Nitharsan Ravi,
OL,12,FInthushan Sriskantharaja and Gurushanth
OL,13,FSrithavarajah died after getting into
OL,14,Fdifficulty in the water at the East
OL,15,FSussex beach on 24 August 2016.
OL,17,FThe anniversary comes after four
OL,18,Fmembers of the same family died in the
OL,19,Fsea at Shoreham last week, prompting
OL,20,Ffresh discussion about water safety.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
