OL,3,GNEWSASea safety warning as deaths
OL,4,Arecalled 10 years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FRNLI lifeguards at Camber Sands said
OL,7,Fthey continued to warn visitors about
OL,8,Fthe risks posed by fast-moving tides,
OL,9,Fwhile Helen Dollimore MP said that
OL,10,Fevery death at sea was "one death too
OL,11,Fmany".
